  m_text: 'Welcome to Luminang!


    Thank you for joining our journey in preserving
    and celebrating the rich languages of the philippines.


    Complete lessons,
    earn coins, unlock achievements, and compete with other learners.


    Don''t
    forget to check the Journal to review the words and phrases you''ve learned already.


    Good
    luck and have fun exploring Ilokano and Cebuano!'
